# Phase 3 T1 BootMatrix: one short dolpic/0 run per pre-written build/Route/<name>/appdata/Sunshine/settings.ini.
# Env: SUNSHINE_DEV_START=dolpic/0 SUNSHINE_DEV_SKIP_MOVIES=1 (+ SUNSHINE_AUDIO_DUMP=<abs wav> for the volume rows).
# Evidence per run (run.log): widescreen: ... render width W, present mode, [launcher] window: size WxH,
# [render] upscaler=, [cheats] N cheats loaded, M active, [glyph] <style>/, [cheats-state] water= before/after the spray;
# boot.png width/height = window size.
waitfor director mario dirstate=4 camDemo=0 timeout=3000
wait frames=60
log
shot boot.png
wait frames=30
# spray: water drops by the spray amount unless infinite_water holds it at the maximum
hold R trig=0,255 frames=90
log
# idle tail: a few more seconds of audio for the dump RMS window
wait frames=300
log
end
